<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 6.99 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 6.99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar dropped slighlty to 6.99 percent on Sunday from 7.1 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in twelve reported transactions with a total value of 14.1 million dinars ($20 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>((-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776))</p>
